{{ 'rituel.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- assign m = all_products['masque-led-visage-cou-silicone-souple-sans-fil'] -%}
{%- assign pk = all_products['pack-rituel-eclat-masque-led-visage-cou-lunettes-led-regard'] -%}
{%- assign gs = all_products['rouleau-de-jade-amp-gua-sha'] -%}
{%- if m.url != blank -%}{%- assign m_url = m.url -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign m_url = '/collections/rituel-eclat' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if pk.url != blank -%}{%- assign pk_url = pk.url -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign pk_url = '/collections/rituel-eclat' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if gs.url != blank -%}{%- assign gs_url = gs.url -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign gs_url = '/collections/rituel-eclat' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if m.price -%}{%- assign m_price = m.price | money -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign m_price = '107,90 €' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if pk.price -%}{%- assign pk_price = pk.price | money -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign pk_price = '144,90 €' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if gs.price -%}{%- assign gs_price = gs.price | money -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign gs_price = '34,00 €' -%}{%- endif -%}

<div class="section section--page-width" style="padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px">
<div class="rt rt-anim" id="rt-masque"><section class="rt-wrap" style="padding-left:0;padding-right:0"><div class="rt-prod">
<div class="rt-prod__img">
{%- if m.images[1] -%}<img src="{{ m.images[1] | image_url: width: 1000 }}" alt="{{ m.images[1].alt | default: m.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1250">
{%- elsif m.featured_image -%}<img src="{{ m.featured_image | image_url: width: 1000 }}" alt="{{ m.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1250">
{%- else -%}<div class="rt-halo"></div><svg class="rt-maskart" viewBox="0 0 200 240" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M100 8c48 0 82 36 82 92 0 62-36 124-82 124S18 162 18 100C18 44 52 8 100 8z" fill="#fff" stroke="#E7B7BD" stroke-width="3"/><ellipse cx="68" cy="96" rx="20" ry="11" fill="#FBEFEC" stroke="#E7B7BD" stroke-width="2"/><ellipse cx="132" cy="96" rx="20" ry="11" fill="#FBEFEC" stroke="#E7B7BD" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M84 176c10 7 22 7 32 0" stroke="#E7B7BD" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><g fill="#E0707E" opacity=".8"><circle cx="60" cy="50" r="3.2"/><circle cx="80" cy="42" r="3.2"/><circle cx="100" cy="40" r="3.2"/><circle cx="120" cy="42" r="3.2"/><circle cx="140" cy="50" r="3.2"/><circle cx="48" cy="128" r="3.2"/><circle cx="62" cy="142" r="3.2"/><circle cx="138" cy="142" r="3.2"/><circle cx="152" cy="128" r="3.2"/><circle cx="70" cy="196" r="3.2"/><circle cx="100" cy="206" r="3.2"/><circle cx="130" cy="196" r="3.2"/><circle cx="100" cy="130" r="3.2"/><circle cx="100" cy="150" r="3.2"/></g></svg>{%- endif -%}
</div>
<div>
<p class="rt-eyebrow">Notre produit phare</p>
<h2>Le masque LED <em>visage &amp; cou</em></h2>
<p class="rt-lead" style="margin-top:14px">Léger, souple et confortable, il épouse les formes de votre visage. Installez-vous, fermez les yeux, choisissez votre lumière : le masque s'occupe du reste et s'arrête tout seul.</p>
<div class="rt-feat">
<div><span class="rt-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 3c4 4 6 7 6 10a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-3 2-6 6-10z"/></svg></span><p><b>Silicone souple</b><span>Qualité alimentaire, 0,35 cm d'épaisseur</span></p></div>
<div><span class="rt-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M9 11v3c0 1 1.3 2 3 2s3-1 3-2v-3M5 21c1-3 3.8-5 7-5s6 2 7 5"/></svg></span><p><b>Visage + cou</b><span>Une pièce dédiée au cou, zone souvent oubliée</span></p></div>
<div><span class="rt-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4"/></svg></span><p><b>7 couleurs de lumière</b><span>Dont la lumière rouge, 103 × 3 LED</span></p></div>
<div><span class="rt-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="6" y="4" width="12" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M10 2h4M11 9l-2 4h4l-2 4"/></svg></span><p><b>Sans prise murale</b><span>Boîtier rechargeable par USB</span></p></div>
<div><span class="rt-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></span><p><b>Minuteur 10 minutes</b><span>Arrêt automatique</span></p></div>
<div><span class="rt-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 11V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3"/><path d="M2 13a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v2h12v-2a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v5H2z"/><path d="M5 18v2M19 18v2"/></svg></span><p><b>Ultra-léger : 202 g</b><span>Au lit, sur le canapé, en voyage</span></p></div>
</div>
<div class="rt-box"><b>Dans la boîte :</b> 1 masque visage, 1 pièce pour le cou, 1 boîtier de commande rechargeable, 1 câble USB, 1 notice d'utilisation.</div>
<div class="rt-price"><b>{{ m_price }}</b><span>Livraison suivie · Retours 14 jours</span></div>
<div class="rt-btns"><a class="rt-btn rt-btn--p" href="{{ m_url }}">Je commande mon masque</a></div>
<p class="rt-small" style="margin-top:14px">Appareil de bien-être à usage cosmétique. Consultez les précautions d'emploi avant utilisation.</p>
</div>
</div></section></div>
</div>
